ght: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="padding: 4px; background-color: #c3d9ff;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0px 3px;font-family:sans-serif"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 2px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="font-family:sans-serif;overflow:auto;width:100%;margin: 0px 10px"&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 0.25em 0 0 0"&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;a href="http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/HolyShmoly/~3/498106972/"&gt;VirtualC64 for Mac OS X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;div style="margin-bottom: 0.5em"&gt;via &lt;a href="http://ocaoimh.ie/" class="f"&gt;Holy Shmoly!&lt;/a&gt; by Donncha on 12/29/08&lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.dirkwhoffmann.de/virtualc64/index.html"&gt;VirtualC64&lt;/a&gt; is a new Commodore 64 emulator for Mac OS X. It&amp;rsquo;s a promising project, let down by the fact that it&amp;rsquo;s still in beta but &lt;a href="http://code.google.com/p/virtualc64/updates/list"&gt;by the looks of things&lt;/a&gt; development is moving at a steady pace.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>